  "USAGE": "⚠⚠ **管線必須走自己的路徑去數，不得重跑本檔的 SQL。** 正確作法：從管線實際寫進 `universe_snapshots` 的列去數（每個 `effective_date` 的相異 `stock_id`，`included` 兩種都算），再與下表比對。**若管線直接重用本 SQL，這個檢查就是拿自己比自己、永遠通過** —— 那正是 §9A.1。",
  "sql_verbatim": "CREATE TABLE cal AS SELECT trade_date d, row_number() OVER (ORDER BY trade_date)::int rk\n  FROM (SELECT DISTINCT trade_date FROM candidate_prices) x;\n\nCREATE TABLE eff AS SELECT c.rk, c.d FROM cal c\n  JOIN (SELECT min(d) md FROM cal GROUP BY date_trunc('month',d)) m ON m.md=c.d\n  WHERE c.rk >= 61;\n\nSELECT e.d AS effective_date,\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id) FILTER (WHERE cp.source='twse_mi_index')     AS twse,\n  count(DISTINCT cp.stock_id) FILTER (WHERE cp.source='tpex_daily_quotes') AS tpex\nFROM eff e JOIN cal c ON c.rk BETWEEN e.rk-59 AND e.rk\nJOIN candidate_prices cp ON cp.trade_date=c.d\nGROUP BY e.d ORDER BY e.d;",
